" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,16)\">Gen 21:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 27:38\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,38)\">Gen 27:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 29:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,11)\">Gen 29:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 2:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,4)\">Judg 2:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,2)\">Judg 21:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 11:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,11,4)\">1Sam 11:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 24:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,24,17)\">1Sam 24:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:32\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,32)\">2Sam 3:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:36\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,36)\">2Sam 13:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 2:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,12)\">Job 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ruth 1:9\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(8,1,9)\">Ruth 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ruth 1:14\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(8,1,14)\">Ruth 1:14</ref>, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּאָזְנֵי י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,18)\">Num 11:18</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Job 30:31\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,31)\">Job 30:31</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> with accusative of congnate meaning with verb <bdbheb>בְּכִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 21:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,2)\">Judg 21:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:36\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,36)\">2Sam 13:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 20:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,20,3)\">2Kgs 20:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 38:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,3)\">Isa 38:3</ref>, compare <bdbheb>בִּבְכִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 16:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,9)\">Isa 16:9</ref>, <bdbheb>מִבְּכִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 48:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,32)\">Jer 48:32</ref>, &amp; <bdbheb>חַרְבֶּה בֶּכֶה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:1\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,1)\">Ezra 10:1</ref> followed by <bdbheb>קוֺל גָּדוֺל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:33\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,33)\">2Sam 15:33</ref>, compare <bdbheb>בקול גדול</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:12\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,12)\">Ezra 3:12</ref> <highlight>weep bitterly</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַר יִב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 33:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,7)\">Isa 33:7</ref> also with infinitive absolute <highlight>weep intensely, grievously</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,10)\">1Sam 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 22:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,10)\">Jer 22:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 1:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,2)\">Lam 1:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 30:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,19)\">Isa 30:19</ref> &amp; <ref ref=\"Mic 1:10\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,10)\">Mic 1:10</ref> (but on text see above) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> followed by <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <highlight>weep upon</highlight>, i.e. embrace and weep, <bdbheb>עַלצֿואריו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 45:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,14)\">Gen 45:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,29)\">Gen 46:29</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Gen 45:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,15)\">Gen 45:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,1)\">Gen 50:1</ref> also <bdbheb>עַלפָּֿנָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,14)\">2Kgs 13:14</ref> see further <ref ref=\"Gen 33:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,4)\">Gen 33:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 45:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,14)\">Gen 45:14</ref> &amp; <bdbheb>וַיִּבְכּוּ אִישׁ אֶתרֵֿעֵהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:41\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,41)\">1Sam 20:41</ref> also followed by <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <highlight>weep over, for</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 11:37\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,37)\">Judg 11:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 11:38\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,38)\">Judg 11:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,34)\">2Sam 3:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 1:16\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,16)\">Lam 1:16</ref> followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֹֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,24)\">2Sam 1:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:32\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,32)\">2Sam 3:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:31\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,31)\">Ezek 27:31</ref> followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 22:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,10)\">Jer 22:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 48:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,32)\">Jer 48:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 30:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,25)\">Job 30:25</ref> followed by <bdbheb>מִפְּנִי</bdbheb> <highlight>because of</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 13:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,17)\">Jer 13:17</ref> followed by temporal clause (of occasion of weeping) <ref ref=\"Gen 50:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,17)\">Gen 50:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 137:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"137\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"137\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,137,1)\">Ps 137:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,9)\">Neh 8:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> followed by accusative <highlight>bewail</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 23:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,2)\">Gen 23:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 37:35\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,35)\">Gen 37:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,3)\">Gen 50:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 10: